The library is extensible and can accommodate future features like packet encryption and decryption. Additionally, it provides comprehensive test coverage for functionality across various edge cases and failure scenarios. The final product is scalable, maintaining high throughput and low latency under heavy load. Optimization is done for both CPU and memory utilization, ensuring efficient performance.']

