The program uses a Sandesh client to send GET requests to external API endpoints and retrieve tokens concurrently, with each token validation request handled by its own thread in the ASIO thread pool. The validation results are stored in a map to ensure data consistency across system instances and conflict resolution strategies for distributed systems.

