To implement comprehensive monitoring and metrics collection for semaphores, the implementation uses a combination of `std::chrono` and `std::atomic` to measure wait times, operation counts, and failure rates. The `acquire()` function will use `std::atomic` to atomically increment counters and timers when a permit is acquired or released, and then report these metrics using `std::chrono`. The implementation also includes real-time alerts and automated recovery mechanisms in case of anomalies.

