To implement the distributed octree data structure, you would need to add methods for inserting, retrieving, and deleting nodes from the octree, as well as methods for managing the configuration parameters and monitoring and logging performance metrics. You would also need to ensure that the data structure is thread-safe and can handle concurrent access from multiple threads.

