The `Parser` struct is responsible for parsing incoming integer data into a more usable format. It uses a custom memory allocator to ensure efficient memory allocation and minimize fragmentation. The parser also incorporates customizable retry mechanisms for transient errors and graceful degradation under resource exhaustion.

